    "notes": "All 10 final portable views inspected. Complete individual broken bell, separate displayed curved fragment, circular light-stone pedestal, flared rim, closed thick fracture edges and inner shoulder, recessed safety grille, open cast crown handles, onion cap and plain cross. Raised bands and original abstract cartouche/rosette relief are on both the bell and displayed fragment. No missing upper body or unintended open shell edge was observed. Ungrounded turntables expose the buried pedestal foundation. Portraits, saints and inscriptions are replaced by original abstract geometry; no navigable interior or copied artwork."
